#: ../developer/deployment.md:1
msgid "Deployment Guide"
msgstr "部署指南"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:3
msgid ""
"Running HybridInference as a long-lived deployment: what starts, how to "
"reach it publicly or keep it private, how to create the first "
"administrator, how to operate it, and how to reset it without losing (or "
"accidentally keeping) data. A staging or scratch instance is the same "
"stack; the sections on keeping it private and on the first admin account "
"matter most there."
msgstr ""
"把 HybridInference "
"作为长期运行的部署来跑：会启动些什么、怎样让它能从公网访问或者不对外暴露、怎样创建第一个管理员、怎么运维，以及怎样在不丢数据（也不会意外留下数据）的前提下重置它。staging"
" 或临时实例跑的也是同一套服务栈；对它们来说，最要紧的是「不对外暴露」和「第一个管理员账号」这两节。"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:9
msgid ""
"First-time setup — cloning, filling in `.env`, and the first `make up` — "
"is in [Installation](installation.md#running-with-docker). This page "
"assumes the stack already comes up."
msgstr ""
"首次搭建——克隆仓库、填写 `.env`、第一次 `make up`——见[安装](installation.md#running-with-"
"docker)。本页假定整套服务栈已经能起来。"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:13
msgid "What the stack is"
msgstr "这套服务栈是什么"

