#: ../developer/deployment.md:23
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"All three published ports default to loopback. A reverse proxy on the "
"same host can reach the console at `127.0.0.1:3001`. The containers also "
"join one bridge network defined in the same Compose file, on which the "
"backend reaches the database as `postgres:5432`. Only `DB_PORT` from "
"`.env` reaches this file, and only as the host half of the mapping "
"(`127.0.0.1:${DB_PORT:-5432}:5432`); the host-side bind address is hard-"
"coded to loopback. `DB_HOST` is pinned to `postgres` in the Compose file "
"and is ignored under Compose — it matters only for a backend started "
"directly from source."
msgstr ""
"三个发布端口都默认绑定到回环地址。同机运行的反向代理可以通过 `127.0.0.1:3001` 访问控制台。容器还会加入同一 Compose "
"文件定义的桥接网络，后端通过该网络中的 `postgres:5432` 访问数据库。`.env` 中只有 `DB_PORT` "
"会传入此文件，并且只用于端口映射的宿主机一侧（`127.0.0.1:${DB_PORT:-5432}:5432`）；宿主机绑定地址固定为回环地址。Compose"
" 文件将 `DB_HOST` 固定为 `postgres`，因此 Compose 模式会忽略该环境变量；它仅对直接从源码启动的后端生效。"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:32
msgid ""
"One more service exists in the same file but starts only when its profile"
" is named: `pgadmin` (profile `admin`)."
msgstr "同一个文件里还有一个服务，只有点名它的 profile 时才会启动：`pgadmin`（profile `admin`）。"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:35
msgid ""
"`frontend` depends on `backend` with `condition: service_started`, not "
"`service_healthy` — deliberately, so that a backend reporting unhealthy "
"because its database logging is down does not stop the console from "
"starting."
msgstr ""
"`frontend` 对 `backend` 的依赖用的是 `condition: service_started` 而不是 "
"`service_healthy`——这是有意为之：backend 因为数据库日志写不进去而报告 unhealthy "
"时，不应该连带拦住控制台启动。"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:40
msgid "Putting it on the public internet"
msgstr "把它放到公网上"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:42
msgid ""
"Nothing in the stack terminates TLS, and this repository ships no "
"reverse-proxy config to copy: certificates and the proxy in front of the "
"two published ports are yours to supply. A proxy running on the host can "
"use `127.0.0.1:3001` for the console or `127.0.0.1:8080` for direct "
"gateway access. A proxy container on the same Docker network can use "
"`frontend:3001` or `backend:8080`."
msgstr ""
"服务栈不负责终止 TLS，仓库也没有可直接复制的反向代理配置；证书和发布端口前面的代理由部署者提供。宿主机上的代理可通过 "
"`127.0.0.1:3001` 访问控制台，或通过 `127.0.0.1:8080` 直接访问网关。同一 Docker 网络中的代理容器可使用 "
"`frontend:3001` 或 `backend:8080`。"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:48
msgid ""
"If your proxy runs on another machine, set `FRONTEND_HOST` to a reachable"
" host interface in `.env`; `0.0.0.0` binds all IPv4 interfaces. Restrict "
"access to the intended proxy and run `make up` to recreate the port "
"mapping. The console forwards API routes as well as serving pages, so "
"exposing its port also exposes those routes. Set `BACKEND_HOST` "
"separately only if direct gateway access is needed."
msgstr ""
"如果代理运行在另一台机器上，在 `.env` 中把 `FRONTEND_HOST` 设置为可达的宿主机接口地址；`0.0.0.0` 会绑定所有 "
"IPv4 接口。将访问限制为预期的代理，并运行 `make up` 重新创建端口映射。控制台在提供页面的同时也会转发 API "
"路由，因此公开它的端口也会公开这些路由。仅在需要直接访问网关时，才单独设置 `BACKEND_HOST`。"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:55
msgid ""
"Releases before the loopback default bound the console to `0.0.0.0`. If a"
" deployment relied on that, set `FRONTEND_HOST` explicitly before "
"upgrading; see [Releases and upgrades](releases.md)."
msgstr ""
"默认改为绑定回环地址之前的版本，会把控制台绑定到 `0.0.0.0`。如果某个部署依赖这一点，请在升级前显式设置 "
"`FRONTEND_HOST`；见[发布与升级](releases.md)。"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:59
msgid ""
"Which public paths the console serves itself and which it forwards to the"
" backend is a separate question, and the answer is in the console's own "
"`next.config.js` rather than in any proxy config. See [The public path "
"table](public-path-table.md)."
msgstr ""
"控制台自己响应哪些公网路径、又把哪些转发给后端，是另一个问题，答案在控制台自己的 `next.config.js` "
"里，而不在任何代理配置里。见[公开路径表](public-path-table.md)。"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:64
msgid "What your proxy still has to do"
msgstr "代理仍然要负责的事"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:66
msgid ""
"Three protections are commonly left to the reverse proxy, and nothing "
"inside this stack provides them. A deployment that exposes the published "
"ports without a proxy — a tunnel daemon connecting to `127.0.0.1:3001`, "
"for instance — has none of them, and nothing warns you:"
msgstr ""
"有三项防护通常交给反向代理来做，这套服务栈内部并不提供。如果部署不经过代理就直接暴露已发布的端口——比如让隧道守护进程直接连到 "
"`127.0.0.1:3001`——这三项防护就一项都没有，而且不会有任何提示："

#: ../developer/deployment.md
msgid "Protection"
msgstr "防护项"

#: ../developer/deployment.md
msgid "What a proxy in front typically does"
msgstr "前置代理通常做什么"

#: ../developer/deployment.md
msgid "Next.js Server Action guard"
msgstr "Next.js Server Action 防护"

#: ../developer/deployment.md
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Refuse requests carrying a `Next-Action` header (`if ($http_next_action) "
"{ return 403; }`), so console server actions cannot be invoked from "
"outside the console"
msgstr ""
"拒绝带 `Next-Action` 头的请求（`if ($http_next_action) { return 403; }`），使控制台的 "
"server action 无法从控制台之外被调用"

#: ../developer/deployment.md
msgid "Request body cap on `/v1/`"
msgstr "`/v1/` 的请求体大小上限"

#: ../developer/deployment.md
msgid ""
"Bound completion request bodies (commonly `client_max_body_size 50m`). "
"The gateway enforces no size limit of its own"
msgstr "限制补全请求的请求体大小（通常是 `client_max_body_size 50m`）。网关自身不施加任何大小限制"

#: ../developer/deployment.md
msgid "`X-Forwarded-For` rewriting"
msgstr "`X-Forwarded-For` 重写"

#: ../developer/deployment.md
msgid ""
"Overwrite a client-supplied chain, so only hops the proxy inserted reach "
"the gateway"
msgstr "覆盖客户端自带的转发链，使只有代理自己插入的跳数能到达网关"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:77
msgid ""
"The gateway reads forwarded headers only from the proxies you authorize "
"(see [Trusted proxies and client IPs](trusted-proxies-and-client-"
"ips.md)), but it never rewrites them. Without a proxy that does, the "
"leftmost `X-Forwarded-For` entry is whatever the caller sent — which is "
"why `CF-Connecting-IP` is preferred when Cloudflare is in front."
msgstr ""
"网关只采信你授权过的代理发来的转发头（见[可信代理与客户端 IP](trusted-proxies-and-client-"
"ips.md)），但它从不改写这些头。前面如果没有负责改写的代理，`X-Forwarded-For` "
"最左边的条目就是调用方自己发来的任意值——这也是前面有 Cloudflare 时优先使用 `CF-Connecting-IP` 的原因。"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:83
msgid "Keeping it private: an SSH tunnel"
msgstr "不对外暴露：SSH 隧道"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:85
msgid ""
"A staging or scratch instance, or any gateway you do not want on a "
"network at all, can keep the loopback defaults. Reach it from your "
"workstation by forwarding both ports:"
msgstr "staging 或临时实例，以及任何你根本不想放到网络上的网关，都可以保留默认的回环绑定。从你的工作机转发这两个端口来访问它："

#: ../developer/deployment.md:93
msgid ""
"Then open `http://localhost:3001`. Keep the local end on `localhost` or "
"`127.0.0.1`: the refresh cookie is issued with the `Secure` flag by "
"default (`COOKIE_SECURE`), and browsers accept `Secure` cookies only over"
" HTTPS or from a loopback origin."
msgstr ""
"然后打开 `http://localhost:3001`。本地这一端要保持在 `localhost` 或 `127.0.0.1`：刷新用的 "
"cookie 默认带 `Secure` 标志（`COOKIE_SECURE`），而浏览器只在 HTTPS 或回环 origin 下才接受 "
"`Secure` cookie。"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:98
msgid ""
"The console talks to the API at whatever `NEXT_PUBLIC_API_BASE` was baked"
" in at image build time — `http://localhost:8080` by default — which is "
"why the tunnel forwards 8080 as well. Changing it is a frontend rebuild, "
"not a restart."
msgstr ""
"控制台访问 API 用的地址，取决于镜像构建时编译进去的 `NEXT_PUBLIC_API_BASE`——默认是 "
"`http://localhost:8080`——这也是隧道要连 8080 一起转发的原因。改这个值意味着重新构建前端，而不是重启。"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:102
msgid ""
"VS Code-family editors can manage the same forwards from their ports "
"panel."
msgstr "VS Code 系列的编辑器可以在自带的端口面板里管理同样的转发。"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:104
msgid "Check the stack answers:"
msgstr "确认这套栈有应答："

#: ../developer/deployment.md:111
msgid ""
"The default `CORS_ALLOWED_ORIGINS` already covers ports 3000, 3001 and "
"3002 on `localhost` and `127.0.0.1`, plus HTTPS on port 8443, so a "
"tunnelled instance needs no CORS entry. Add one only when you serve the "
"console from another origin."
msgstr ""
"`CORS_ALLOWED_ORIGINS` 的默认值已经覆盖 `localhost` 和 `127.0.0.1` 上的 "
"3000、3001、3002 端口，外加 8443 端口上的 HTTPS，所以走隧道访问的实例不需要再加 CORS 条目。只有当控制台由别的 "
"origin 提供时才需要加。"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:116
msgid "Everyday operations"
msgstr "日常运维"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:118
msgid "All from the repository root:"
msgstr "以下命令都在仓库根目录执行："

#: ../developer/deployment.md:132
msgid ""
"`make up` and `make build` first run the `docker-volumes` target, which "
"creates the external volume `hybridinference_postgres_data` when it is "
"missing."
msgstr ""
"`make up` 和 `make build` 会先执行 `docker-volumes` 目标，在外部卷 "
"`hybridinference_postgres_data` 不存在时创建它。"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:135
msgid ""
"To start an optional profile, pass it on the `make` command line — a "
"variable set there is exported into the environment of the recipe, and a "
"shell variable outranks every `--env-file` in Compose:"
msgstr ""
"要启动某个可选 profile，就在 `make` 命令行上传入——在那里设置的变量会导出到 recipe 的环境中，而在 Compose 里 "
"shell 变量的优先级高于任何 `--env-file`："

#: ../developer/deployment.md:143
msgid ""
"`COMPOSE_PROFILES` is a comma-separated list, so you can name several "
"profiles at once. It can also be set in `.env` (as `.env.example` notes),"
" but the command line is the form to reach for when you want certainty "
"about which profiles are active."
msgstr ""
"`COMPOSE_PROFILES` 是逗号分隔的列表，所以可以一次指定多个 profile。它也可以写在 `.env` "
"里（`.env.example` 有说明），但想确定哪些 profile 真的生效时，优先用命令行这种写法。"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:148
msgid "What a change actually requires"
msgstr "一次改动到底需要做什么"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:150
msgid ""
"Three different answers, and picking the wrong one looks like the change "
"not taking effect:"
msgstr "答案有三种，选错的表现就是改动看起来没生效："

#: ../developer/deployment.md
msgid "You changed"
msgstr "你改了什么"

#: ../developer/deployment.md
msgid "Do this"
msgstr "该怎么做"

#: ../developer/deployment.md
msgid "A value in `.env`"
msgstr "`.env` 里的某个值"

#: ../developer/deployment.md
msgid ""
"`make up` — a container reads its `env_file` when it is *created*, so "
"`docker compose restart` keeps the old environment"
msgstr "`make up`——容器只在*创建*时读取自己的 `env_file`，所以 `docker compose restart` 会沿用旧的环境变量"

#: ../developer/deployment.md
msgid "A model registry or routing YAML"
msgstr "模型注册表或路由 YAML"

#: ../developer/deployment.md
msgid ""
"`make restart s=backend` — `config/` and `distributions/` are bind-"
"mounted read-only, so no rebuild is needed"
msgstr ""
"`make restart s=backend`——`config/` 和 `distributions/` 是以只读方式 bind-mount "
"进去的，不需要重新构建"

#: ../developer/deployment.md
msgid "A distribution branding YAML"
msgstr "发行版的品牌 YAML"

#: ../developer/deployment.md
msgid ""
"`make restart s=backend` — `/site-config` serves the validated snapshot "
"loaded at backend startup"
msgstr "`make restart s=backend`——`/site-config` 提供后端启动时加载并校验过的快照"

#: ../developer/deployment.md
msgid "A file in the mounted site-assets directory"
msgstr "挂载的 site-assets 目录中的文件"

#: ../developer/deployment.md
msgid "No image rebuild; replace the file in the deployment overlay"
msgstr "无需重建镜像；替换部署 overlay 中的文件"

#: ../developer/deployment.md
msgid "`AGENT_WEB_INTERNAL_URL` or `AGENT_CONTROL_PLANE_INTERNAL_URL`"
msgstr "`AGENT_WEB_INTERNAL_URL` 或 `AGENT_CONTROL_PLANE_INTERNAL_URL`"

#: ../developer/deployment.md
msgid ""
"`make up` — the `/agents` route handler reads them at runtime in the "
"recreated frontend container"
msgstr "`make up`——重新创建的 frontend 容器会由 `/agents` route handler 在运行时读取它们"

#: ../developer/deployment.md
msgid "A true build-only `NEXT_PUBLIC_*` compatibility value"
msgstr "真正只在构建时生效的 `NEXT_PUBLIC_*` 兼容值"

#: ../developer/deployment.md
msgid "`make build s=frontend` — see below"
msgstr "`make build s=frontend`——见下文"

#: ../developer/deployment.md
msgid "Backend or frontend source"
msgstr "后端或前端的源码"

#: ../developer/deployment.md
msgid "`make build`, or `make build s=<service>`"
msgstr "`make build`，或 `make build s=<service>`"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:163
msgid ""
"The console gets its name and branding from the backend's `/site-config` "
"at runtime, and the `/agents` destinations from its own runtime "
"environment, so neither needs a new frontend image: restart the backend "
"after editing the branding file, and run `make up` after changing the "
"console's environment."
msgstr ""
"控制台在运行时从后端的 `/site-config` 获取名称和品牌，从自己的运行时环境获取 `/agents` "
"的目标地址，所以两者都不需要新的前端镜像：改了品牌文件就重启后端，改了控制台的环境变量就运行 `make up`。"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:168
msgid ""
"The console will not render its normal pages without a valid `/site-"
"config` answer. If the backend is unreachable, slow (over three seconds) "
"or returns something invalid, the console shows a configuration error "
"with a retry button instead of guessing. Check the frontend logs and "
"whether the backend is up, then retry. The example deployment needs no "
"extra settings for this."
msgstr ""
"拿不到有效的 `/site-config` "
"响应，控制台就不会渲染正常页面。如果后端连不上、太慢（超过三秒）或者返回了无效内容，控制台会显示一个带重试按钮的配置错误，而不会自己去猜。先查看前端日志，确认后端是否在运行，然后重试。示例部署不需要为此做任何额外设置。"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:174
msgid ""
"A few older build-time options remain for existing build pipelines: the "
"old branding variables, which Compose still accepts as build arguments, "
"and two agent build arguments that it no longer sets. Standard builds do "
"not need them. Anything that really is a `NEXT_PUBLIC_*` build value is "
"compiled into the browser bundle and needs `make build s=frontend`; see "
"[The public path table](public-path-table.md)."
msgstr ""
"为了兼容现有的构建流水线，还保留了几个旧的构建期选项：旧的品牌变量（Compose 仍然接受它们作为构建参数），以及两个 Compose "
"已经不再设置的 agent 构建参数。标准构建用不到它们。真正属于 `NEXT_PUBLIC_*` 构建值的内容会被编译进浏览器 "
"bundle，改动它需要 `make build s=frontend`；见[公开路径表](public-path-table.md)。"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:181
msgid "Configuration"
msgstr "配置"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:183
msgid "Environment"
msgstr "环境变量"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:185
msgid ""
"Everything is in `.env` at the repository root; `.env.example` is the "
"annotated list. Compose is invoked with `--env-file .env` and the backend"
" service also loads it as `env_file`. The variables Compose itself "
"requires, and the two secrets you should not leave blank, are in "
"[Installation](installation.md#running-with-docker)."
msgstr ""
"所有配置都在仓库根目录的 `.env` 里；`.env.example` 是带注释的清单。Compose 以 `--env-file .env` "
"调用，backend 服务同时把它作为 `env_file` 加载。Compose "
"自身要求的变量，以及不该留空的那两个密钥，见[安装](installation.md#running-with-docker)。"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:191
msgid "Config file resolution"
msgstr "配置文件的解析顺序"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:193
msgid ""
"The gateway picks each configuration file from an explicit "
"`MODELS_CONFIG_PATH` / `ROUTING_CONFIG_PATH` / `ALERTS_CONFIG_PATH`, then"
" an active distribution manifest, then the examples under "
"`config/examples/`; see [How a gateway finds its "
"config](configuration.md#how-a-gateway-finds-its-config)."
msgstr ""
"网关按以下顺序选取每个配置文件：先是显式设置的 `MODELS_CONFIG_PATH` / `ROUTING_CONFIG_PATH` / "
"`ALERTS_CONFIG_PATH`，然后是已启用的发行版 manifest，最后是 `config/examples/` "
"下的示例；见[网关如何找到自己的配置](configuration.md#how-a-gateway-finds-its-config)。"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:198
msgid "Note that the Compose file passes these through explicitly:"
msgstr "注意，Compose 文件是显式把它们透传进去的："

#: ../developer/deployment.md:206
msgid ""
"An `--env-file` alone does not put a variable into a container's "
"environment; these lines are what carry it in. Without them the gateway "
"would silently fall back to the default files."
msgstr "光有 `--env-file` 并不能把变量放进容器的环境里；真正把它带进去的是这几行。没有它们，网关就会悄悄回退到默认文件。"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:210
msgid "Local inference servers"
msgstr "本地推理服务器"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:212
msgid ""
"The backend container reaches servers on the host through "
"`host.docker.internal`, which the Compose file wires with `extra_hosts: "
"host.docker.internal:host-gateway`. Write that address explicitly in the "
"model registry:"
msgstr ""
"backend 容器通过 `host.docker.internal` 访问宿主机上的服务器，Compose 文件用 `extra_hosts: "
"host.docker.internal:host-gateway` 把它接好。要在模型注册表里显式写上这个地址："

#: ../developer/deployment.md:223
msgid ""
"For a backend running directly on the host, use `localhost` instead. The "
"gateway never rewrites provider URLs. See [Adding a New Local Model](add-"
"local-model.md)."
msgstr ""
"如果 backend 直接跑在宿主机上，就改用 `localhost`。网关从不改写 provider 的 URL。见[添加新的本地模型"
"](add-local-model.md)。"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:227
msgid "Health checks"
msgstr "健康检查"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:246
msgid ""
"`routes_configured` counts published route entries — one per model id in "
"the active registry, plus one per alias. It is whatever *your* registry "
"defines."
msgstr ""
"`routes_configured` 统计的是已发布的路由条目——生效的注册表里每个模型 id "
"一条，每个别名再加一条。它完全取决于*你自己的*注册表定义了什么。"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:248
msgid ""
"`database_configured` distinguishes \"this deployment asked for no "
"database\" from \"the database is down\": with `DB_ENABLED=false` it is "
"`false` and the status is still `healthy`; with a database configured but"
" unreachable at startup, `/health` answers **503** with `\"reason\": "
"\"database_unavailable_at_startup\"`."
msgstr ""
"`database_configured` 区分的是「这个部署本来就不要数据库」和「数据库挂了」：`DB_ENABLED=false` 时它是 "
"`false`，状态仍然是 `healthy`；而配置了数据库、启动时却连不上时，`/health` 返回 **503**，并带上 "
"`\"reason\": \"database_unavailable_at_startup\"`。"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:253
msgid ""
"`status` becomes `degraded` — still HTTP 200 — when one configured store "
"is down but the other is serving. That shape is deliberate: the container"
" `HEALTHCHECK` uses `curl -f /health`, so returning 503 for partial "
"degradation would tear down backends that are still answering requests."
msgstr ""
"当已配置的两个存储中一个挂了、另一个还在服务时，`status` 变成 `degraded`——HTTP 状态码仍是 "
"200。这个形态是有意设计的：容器的 `HEALTHCHECK` 用的是 `curl -f /health`，若对部分降级返回 "
"503，就会把仍在正常响应请求的 backend 拆掉。"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:258
msgid ""
"Use `/health/ready` for a strict readiness probe: it applies AND-logic "
"across configured stores and returns 503 unless every one of them is up. "
"`/health/deep` additionally reports per-endpoint health."
msgstr ""
"要做严格的就绪探针，请用 `/health/ready`：它对已配置的各个存储取与逻辑，只要有一个没起来就返回 "
"503。`/health/deep` 还会额外报告每个端点的健康状况。"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:262
msgid "Marking monitor traffic"
msgstr "给监控流量打标记"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:264
msgid ""
"A monitor that drives real inference — hitting `/v1/chat/completions` on "
"a schedule to measure a backend end to end, rather than just polling "
"`/health` — would otherwise land in `api_logs`, skew the dashboards, and "
"feed RouteWise's online learning as if it were user demand. Send "
"`X-Probe: synthetic` on those requests to keep them out: a marked request"
" is left out of `api_logs` (and its rejections out of the rejection log),"
" does not record a routing observation, and carries an `X-Provider` "
"response header naming the backend that answered, so the monitor can "
"confirm which route it exercised."
msgstr ""
"一个真正驱动推理的监控——按计划打 `/v1/chat/completions` 来端到端测量某个后端，而不只是轮询 "
"`/health`——本来会落进 `api_logs`、把看板数据带偏，还会被 RouteWise 的在线学习当成真实需求。给这些请求带上 "
"`X-Probe: synthetic` 就能把它们排除在外：被打标记的请求不写进 "
"`api_logs`（它的拒绝也不进拒绝日志），不记录路由观测，并且响应会带一个 `X-Provider` "
"头指明是哪个后端应答的，方便监控确认自己命中的是哪条路由。"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:273
msgid ""
"The marker is honoured **only from an authenticated internal- or admin-"
"role API key** — never a free/pro key, an agent-sandbox grant, or, "
"importantly, an anonymous caller on a deployment running with "
"`USER_AUTH_ENABLED=0` (auth-off hands every caller the admin role, which "
"is not the same as holding a monitor identity). From any other caller the"
" header is ignored and the request is logged like ordinary traffic. A "
"deployment that needs probes without auth wants an explicit mechanism — a"
" shared secret, a source allowlist — not this header."
msgstr ""
"这个标记**只有来自已鉴权的 internal 或 admin 角色 API key 时才被采信**——free/pro key 不行，agent"
" 沙箱的 grant 不行，尤其是在 `USER_AUTH_ENABLED=0` 的部署上，匿名调用方也不行（关掉鉴权会给每个调用方发 admin"
" "
"角色，但那和「持有一个可验证的监控身份」不是一回事）。来自其他任何调用方时，这个头会被忽略，请求照普通流量记录。需要在无鉴权情况下做探测的部署，应该用一个显式机制——一个共享密钥、一个来源白名单——而不是这个头。"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:281
msgid ""
"The marker is about noise, not access. It cannot keep a monitor's own "
"auth failures from tripping the repeated-auth-failure blocklist, because "
"that decision is made before the presented key is read — see [A monitor "
"or service account is suddenly getting 429s](#a-monitor-or-service-"
"account-is-suddenly-getting-429s)."
msgstr ""
"这个标记管的是噪声，不是访问权限。它没法让监控自身的认证失败不去触发重复认证失败黑名单，因为那个判断发生在读取所带密钥之前——见[监控或服务账号突然开始收到"
" 429](#a-monitor-or-service-account-is-suddenly-getting-429s)。"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:287
msgid ""
"The one thing the marker never touches is billing: cost and quota are "
"incremented unconditionally on every surface, for trusted and untrusted "
"callers alike, so a probe cannot be used to obtain unmetered inference. "
"To keep marked traffic in `api_logs` after all — to see a monitor's real "
"latency and spend in the requests dashboard — turn on the "
"`log_synthetic_probes` runtime setting; the routing-observation and "
"`X-Provider` behaviour is unchanged."
msgstr ""
"这个标记唯一从不触碰的是计费：成本和配额在每个接口面上都无条件累加，对被信任和不被信任的调用方一视同仁，所以探测标记没法用来白嫖不计量的推理。如果你反而想把被标记的流量保留在"
" `api_logs` 里——好在请求看板里看到监控的真实延迟和花费——打开 `log_synthetic_probes` "
"这个运行时设置即可；路由观测和 `X-Provider` 的行为不变。"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:294
msgid "Alerting"
msgstr "告警"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:296
msgid ""
"The backend has an in-process alert engine that posts to a Slack webhook."
" It is off unless you turn it on:"
msgstr "后端内置了一个进程内告警引擎，会向 Slack webhook 推送。不显式打开就是关闭的："

#: ../developer/deployment.md:304
msgid ""
"If `SLACK_ALERTS_WEBHOOK_URL` is empty it falls back to "
"`SLACK_WEBHOOK_URL`, so one webhook can serve both code paths."
msgstr ""
"`SLACK_ALERTS_WEBHOOK_URL` 为空时会回退到 `SLACK_WEBHOOK_URL`，所以一个 webhook "
"可以同时服务两条代码路径。"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:307
msgid ""
"Rules and thresholds are a deployment's own; this repository ships no "
"alerts file. Point `ALERTS_CONFIG_PATH` at yours, or leave it unset and "
"the built-in thresholds apply. The rule types and evaluation live in "
"`apps/backend/serving/observability/`."
msgstr ""
"规则和阈值属于各个部署自己，本仓库不提供告警文件。把 `ALERTS_CONFIG_PATH` "
"指向你自己的文件；或者不设置它，那就使用内置阈值。规则类型和求值逻辑在 "
"`apps/backend/serving/observability/`。"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:312
msgid ""
"Two auth rules are worth knowing apart, because their defaults differ on "
"purpose:"
msgstr "有两条认证相关的规则值得分清，因为它们的默认值是有意不同的："

#: ../developer/deployment.md:315
msgid ""
"`rules.auth_failure_spike` is **off**. Bad keys are internet background "
"noise, and a count of them names nothing to act on. The `auth_failure` "
"log records are emitted regardless."
msgstr ""
"`rules.auth_failure_spike` "
"默认**关闭**。错误密钥属于互联网背景噪声，把它们数出来并指不出任何可操作的东西。无论这条规则开不开，`auth_failure` "
"日志记录都照常输出。"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:318
msgid ""
"`rules.auth_ip_blocked` is **on**. This one fires when the blocklist "
"starts *refusing* a source — a discrete decision at a much higher "
"threshold, naming an address. It is on because the source is sometimes "
"the deployment's own; see the troubleshooting entry below."
msgstr ""
"`rules.auth_ip_blocked` "
"默认**开启**。它在黑名单开始*拒绝*某个来源时触发——那是一个在高得多的阈值上做出、并且点名到具体地址的离散判断。之所以默认开启，是因为被拒的来源有时正是本部署自己的调用方；见下面的排查条目。"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:323
msgid "What an auth alert tells you"
msgstr "认证告警里有什么"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:325
msgid ""
"An auth-failure card names the sources and, where it can, the accounts "
"behind them — the addresses they came from, how many distinct ones, the "
"leading characters of the keys presented, why each failed, and the paths "
"being hit. The recovery card carries the same picture of the incident "
"that just closed, rather than only the rule's name: by the time a spike "
"resolves, the window it breached on is empty, so the numbers have to come"
" from a tally kept across the incident."
msgstr "认证失败告警会指出这些来源，并在力所能及时指出它们背后的账户——它们来自哪些地址、有多少个不同的地址、所出示密钥的开头字符、每次失败的原因，以及正在被访问的路径。恢复告警给出的是刚刚结束的这次事件的同一幅图景，而不只是规则的名字：尖峰恢复时，它当初越过阈值的那个时间窗口已经空了，所以这些数字只能来自一份贯穿整个事件的累计统计。"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:332
msgid "Two of those lines are worth reading carefully:"
msgstr "其中有两行值得仔细读："

#: ../developer/deployment.md:334
msgid ""
"**Known accounts.** Most auth failures are anonymous by construction — "
"nobody was authenticated, which is the failure. A named account means a "
"key this deployment *did* issue was presented and refused, with "
"`credential_state` saying why (`revoked`, `expired`, `user_suspended`). "
"That is the actionable case: a monitor, CI job or service account whose "
"credential went stale. Resolving the owner costs one indexed lookup per "
"failed auth, bounded by the shared rejection-enrichment budget and shed "
"instantly under a flood; set `AUTH_FAILURE_IDENTIFY_CALLER=false` to "
"spend nothing and lose the line. Read a named account as evidence and no "
"named account as *unknown*, never as proof the traffic is external: the "
"lookup is shed during exactly the flood you are investigating, and "
"answers nothing on a timeout, a failed lookup, or with the setting off."
msgstr ""
"**已知账户**。绝大多数认证失败在构成上就是匿名的——没有任何人通过认证，这正是失败本身。出现了账户，说明有人出示了本部署*确实*签发过的密钥而被拒绝，`credential_state`"
" 会说明原因（`revoked`、`expired`、`user_suspended`）。这才是可处理的那一类：某个监控、CI "
"任务或服务账户的凭据已经失效。解析持有者的代价是每次认证失败一次索引查询，受共享的拒绝请求富化预算约束，洪泛之下会被立即丢弃；设为 "
"`AUTH_FAILURE_IDENTIFY_CALLER=false` "
"即可分文不花，代价是失去这一行。把出现账户读作证据，把没有账户读作*未知*，而绝不要读作流量来自外部的证明：这个查询恰恰会在你正在排查的那场洪泛里被丢弃，并且在超时、查询失败或该设置被关闭时都不会给出任何结果。"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:346
msgid ""
"**Arrived via peers.** Present only when the reported addresses did not "
"come off the socket. They are then only as trustworthy as the proxy that "
"set them, and a forged `X-Forwarded-For` is exactly how a source spreads "
"its failures across the blocklist's buckets. The line names the sockets "
"they actually arrived on."
msgstr ""
"**通过对端到达**。只有当报告出来的地址并非取自套接字时才会出现。这时它们的可信度只等同于设置它们的那层代理，而伪造 `X-Forwarded-"
"For` 正是一个来源把自己的失败分散到封禁名单各个分桶里的办法。这一行给出它们真正到达时所用的套接字地址。"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:352
msgid ""
"Counts marked `(capped)` are floors, not totals: a source rotating "
"addresses faster than the tally tracks them stops being counted rather "
"than being allowed to grow it without bound. Do not size an incident from"
" a capped number."
msgstr ""
"标记为 `(capped)` "
"的计数是下限而不是总数：一个来源轮换地址的速度快过统计所能跟踪的上限时，它就不再被计入，而不是被允许把统计无限撑大。不要用一个带上限标记的数字去估量事件的规模。"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:356
msgid "Silencing alerts from the dashboard"
msgstr "在仪表盘中静音告警"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:358
msgid ""
"The admin dashboard's Settings tab has two controls, and neither changes "
"your alerts file:"
msgstr "管理仪表盘的 Settings 标签页里有两个开关，两者都不会改动你的告警文件："

#: ../developer/deployment.md:361
msgid "**Slack Alerts** snoozes every alert for up to seven days."
msgstr "**Slack Alerts** 可以暂停所有告警，最长七天。"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:362
msgid ""
"**Alert Types** mutes one type of alert, such as `auth_ip_blocked` or "
"`circuit_open`, for an hour, a day, a week, or until it is unmuted. Every"
" other type keeps sending."
msgstr ""
"**Alert Types** 可以静音某一类告警，例如 `auth_ip_blocked` 或 "
"`circuit_open`，时长为一小时、一天、一周，或直到手动取消静音。其他类型照常发送。"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:366
msgid ""
"A mute is stored in the database, so it survives a restart and reaches "
"every gateway process within a few seconds. While a type is muted nothing"
" of it is sent, and an incident that opens during the mute also closes "
"without a recovery message. An incident that was posted before the mute "
"still gets its recovery, and a breach still live when the mute lifts "
"pages at its next evaluation. A mute is for an alert you want back later;"
" to retire a rule for good, turn it off in your alerts file instead."
msgstr "静音保存在数据库里，因此重启后依然有效，并会在几秒内作用到每个网关进程。某类告警被静音期间，它的任何消息都不会发出；静音期间开始的事件在关闭时也不会发送恢复消息。静音之前已经发出的事件仍会收到恢复消息；静音解除时如果越限仍在持续，会在下一次评估时立即告警。静音适用于你之后还想恢复的告警；要彻底停用某条规则，请改为在告警文件中关闭它。"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:374
msgid "The first admin account"
msgstr "第一个管理员账号"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:376
msgid ""
"Every deployment needs one administrator to start with. Choose how you "
"create it with care:"
msgstr "每个部署一开始都需要一个管理员。创建方式要慎重选择："

#: ../developer/deployment.md:380
msgid ""
"Do not combine `SIGNUP_ENABLED=1`, `SIGNUP_REQUIRE_EMAIL_VERIFICATION=0` "
"and `ADMIN_EMAILS` on an instance anyone else can reach. Together they "
"are a privilege-escalation recipe:"
msgstr ""
"不要在别人能访问到的实例上同时用 `SIGNUP_ENABLED=1`、`SIGNUP_REQUIRE_EMAIL_VERIFICATION=0`"
" 和 `ADMIN_EMAILS`。这三者凑在一起就是一份提权配方："

#: ../developer/deployment.md:384
msgid ""
"with verification disabled, `POST /auth/signup` marks any address as "
"verified without sending mail to it;"
msgstr "关闭验证后，`POST /auth/signup` 会把任何地址都标记为已验证，却根本不往这个地址发邮件；"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:386
msgid ""
"on login *and* on every token refresh, the backend promotes any account "
"whose address is listed in `ADMIN_EMAILS` from `free` to `admin`, with no"
" check that the person signing up owns that address."
msgstr ""
"登录时*以及*每一次 token 刷新时，后端都会把地址列在 `ADMIN_EMAILS` 里的账号从 `free` 提升为 "
"`admin`，并不检查注册的人是否真的拥有那个地址。"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:390
msgid ""
"So a stranger who guesses or reads your `ADMIN_EMAILS` value signs up "
"with that address and is an admin on their first login."
msgstr "于是，猜到或看到你 `ADMIN_EMAILS` 取值的陌生人，用那个地址注册，第一次登录就已经是管理员。"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:394
msgid "Pick one of these instead."
msgstr "改用下面两种做法之一。"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:396
msgid ""
"**Preferred — create the admin out of band and leave `ADMIN_EMAILS` "
"unset.** `ops/admin/create_admin.py` writes the row directly: it creates "
"the account with `role='admin'`, `status='active'`, "
"`email_verified=TRUE`, or promotes an existing account with the same "
"address. Run it from the repository root once the backend has started at "
"least once (the backend creates the schema):"
msgstr ""
"**推荐——在带外创建管理员，并且不设置 `ADMIN_EMAILS`**。`ops/admin/create_admin.py` "
"直接写这一行数据：它以 `role='admin'`、`status='active'`、`email_verified=TRUE` "
"创建账号，或者把同地址的已有账号提升上去。等后端至少启动过一次之后（表结构由后端创建），在仓库根目录运行："

#: ../developer/deployment.md:406
msgid ""
"Run it inside the project environment (`source .venv/bin/activate` after "
"`make setup-dev`) so the `serving` package is importable. It reads "
"`DB_HOST`, `DB_PORT`, `DB_NAME`, `DB_USER` and `DB_PASSWORD` from `.env`,"
" and Postgres publishes on `127.0.0.1:5432`, so it works from the host "
"shell. Omit `--password` and it prompts, keeping the password out of your"
" shell history. With this in place the instance can run with signup "
"closed:"
msgstr ""
"要在项目环境里运行（`make setup-dev` 之后 `source .venv/bin/activate`），这样才 import 得到 "
"`serving` 包。它从 `.env` 读取 `DB_HOST`、`DB_PORT`、`DB_NAME`、`DB_USER` 和 "
"`DB_PASSWORD`，而 Postgres 发布在 `127.0.0.1:5432`，所以在宿主机的 shell 里就能跑。不加 "
"`--password` 它会交互提示，密码也就不会进入 shell 历史。这样安排好之后，实例就可以关掉注册来运行："

#: ../developer/deployment.md:418
msgid ""
"**Alternative — keep signup open, but leave verification on.** "
"`SIGNUP_REQUIRE_EMAIL_VERIFICATION` defaults to `true`, and with it on an"
" account cannot log in until it has followed a link sent to the address, "
"which restores the ownership check that `ADMIN_EMAILS` itself does not "
"perform. This needs working SMTP; without it nobody can complete a "
"signup."
msgstr ""
"**备选——保持注册开放，但保留邮箱验证**。`SIGNUP_REQUIRE_EMAIL_VERIFICATION` 默认为 "
"`true`，开着的时候，账号必须先点开发往该地址的链接才能登录，这就补回了 `ADMIN_EMAILS` 自己不做的所有权检查。这需要一套可用的"
" SMTP；没有 SMTP 就没人能完成注册。"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:424
msgid ""
"`ADMIN_EMAILS` also picks the default recipients for signup approval "
"mail. To narrow the notification list without changing who holds the "
"admin role, set `SIGNUP_NOTIFY_EMAILS` (comma-separated); when it is "
"empty, notifications fall back to `ADMIN_EMAILS`."
msgstr ""
"`ADMIN_EMAILS` 同时决定注册审批邮件的默认收件人。要在不改变谁持有管理员角色的前提下缩小通知名单，就设置 "
"`SIGNUP_NOTIFY_EMAILS`（逗号分隔）；它为空时，通知回退到 `ADMIN_EMAILS`。"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:433
msgid ""
"Both `signup_enabled` and `signup_require_email_verification` can also be"
" flipped at runtime through the settings store, and the runtime value "
"wins over the environment. A `.env` line is the starting point, not a "
"guarantee."
msgstr ""
"`signup_enabled` 和 `signup_require_email_verification` 也都能在运行时通过 settings"
" store 翻转，而且运行时的值优先于环境变量。`.env` 里的一行只是起点，不是保证。"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:437
msgid "Database"
msgstr "数据库"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:439
msgid ""
"PostgreSQL 16 runs in the `postgres` service with its data in the Docker "
"volume `hybridinference_postgres_data`. A psql shell:"
msgstr ""
"PostgreSQL 16 跑在 `postgres` 服务里，数据放在 Docker 卷 "
"`hybridinference_postgres_data` 中。开一个 psql shell："

#: ../developer/deployment.md:446
msgid "Schema details are in [Database](database.md)."
msgstr "表结构细节见[数据库](database.md)。"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:448
msgid "pgAdmin (optional)"
msgstr "pgAdmin（可选）"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:454
msgid ""
"pgAdmin then listens on `127.0.0.1:5050` with `SCRIPT_NAME=/pgadmin`, so "
"an SSH tunnel to that port is enough to reach it. The console can also "
"proxy it at `/pgadmin/`, gated on an admin session by "
"`apps/frontend/src/app/pgadmin/[[...path]]/route.ts`, which denies on "
"every unexpected condition, including a backend it cannot reach."
msgstr ""
"pgAdmin 随后监听 `127.0.0.1:5050`，并带 `SCRIPT_NAME=/pgadmin`，所以向该端口开一条 SSH "
"隧道就足以访问它。控制台也可以在 `/pgadmin/` 下代理它，由 "
"`apps/frontend/src/app/pgadmin/[[...path]]/route.ts` 按 admin "
"会话把关；该文件在任何非预期情况下都拒绝，包括连不上后端的时候。"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:460
msgid ""
"One thing to get right: whether pgAdmin *also* asks for its own login is "
"set by `PGADMIN_CONFIG_SERVER_MODE`, and the two defaults disagree. The "
"Compose service falls back to `False`, which serves pgAdmin with no login"
" at all; `.env.example` suggests `True`, which turns pgAdmin's own login "
"on behind the console's gate. `True` is the safer of the two."
msgstr ""
"有一点要弄对：pgAdmin 是否*另外*要求它自己的登录，由 `PGADMIN_CONFIG_SERVER_MODE` "
"决定，而两处的默认值并不一致。Compose 服务回退到 `False`，也就是完全不需要登录就能用 pgAdmin；`.env.example`"
" 建议 `True`，也就是在控制台这道关卡之后再开启 pgAdmin 自己的登录。两者之中 `True` 更安全。"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:466
msgid "Troubleshooting"
msgstr "故障排查"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:468
msgid "A service will not start"
msgstr "某个服务起不来"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:475
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"`required variable DB_NAME is missing a value: DB_NAME must be set in "
".env file` — Compose stopped at interpolation before starting anything. "
"`DB_NAME`, `DB_USER` and `DB_PASSWORD` are declared required with the "
"`${VAR:?message}` form, so the half after the colon is the Compose file's"
" own text and the most greppable part of the line."
msgstr ""
"`required variable DB_NAME is missing a value: DB_NAME must be set in "
".env file`——Compose 在变量插值阶段就停下了，什么都还没启动。`DB_NAME`、`DB_USER` 和 "
"`DB_PASSWORD` 是用 `${VAR:?message}` 形式声明为必填的，所以冒号之后那半句是 Compose "
"文件自己写的文案，也是这一行里最好 grep 的部分。"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:480
msgid ""
"Port already in use — override `BACKEND_PORT`, `FRONTEND_PORT` or "
"`DB_PORT`."
msgstr "端口已被占用——覆盖 `BACKEND_PORT`、`FRONTEND_PORT` 或 `DB_PORT`。"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:481
msgid ""
"Database connection failed — check `make ps` for the `postgres` health "
"status."
msgstr "数据库连接失败——用 `make ps` 查看 `postgres` 的健康状态。"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:483
msgid "A monitor or service account is suddenly getting 429s"
msgstr "监控或服务账号突然开始收到 429"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:485
msgid ""
"`Too many authentication failures from this IP. Temporarily blocked.` is "
"the gateway's own abuse defense, not a provider error and not a quota. "
"Once a source accumulates `AUTH_FAILURE_BLOCK_THRESHOLD` failed "
"authentications inside `AUTH_FAILURE_BLOCK_WINDOW_SEC` (200 in a day, by "
"default) it is refused for `AUTH_FAILURE_BLOCK_DURATION_SEC` (a day)."
msgstr ""
"`Too many authentication failures from this IP. Temporarily blocked.` "
"是网关自己的滥用防护，既不是provider 的错误，也不是配额。一个来源在 `AUTH_FAILURE_BLOCK_WINDOW_SEC` "
"之内累计到 `AUTH_FAILURE_BLOCK_THRESHOLD` 次认证失败（默认是一天 200 次）之后，就会被拒绝 "
"`AUTH_FAILURE_BLOCK_DURATION_SEC`（一天）。"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:491
msgid ""
"The awkward case is a caller you own — a status monitor, a CI job, a "
"service account — whose key was rotated, revoked, or never reached its "
"environment. It retries on a schedule, crosses the threshold, and is then"
" refused *ahead of the key check*, which has two consequences:"
msgstr ""
"麻烦的情形是你自己的调用方——状态监控、CI "
"任务、服务账号——它的密钥被轮换了、被吊销了，或者根本没进到它的运行环境里。它按计划不断重试，越过阈值，然后就在*密钥检查之前*被拒绝，这带来两个后果："

#: ../developer/deployment.md:496
msgid ""
"**Repairing the credential does not lift the block.** The blocklist is "
"consulted before the presented key is read, so a corrected key gets the "
"same 429 until the deadline passes."
msgstr "**修好凭据并不会解除封禁**。黑名单的判断发生在读取所带密钥之前，所以在期限走完之前，正确的密钥拿到的还是同一个 429。"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:499
msgid ""
"**The 429 hides the original error.** Whatever the caller reports after "
"the block is in place says nothing about whether the underlying 401/403 "
"was fixed."
msgstr "**429 掩盖了原始错误**。封禁生效之后，调用方报什么都说明不了底层那个 401/403 究竟修好了没有。"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:502
msgid ""
"Which caller is it? Turn on the `log_rejected_requests` admin setting and"
" the refusals land in Recent Requests as `ip_blocked` rows. Each row "
"names the account behind the key the caller presented — including a key "
"that was revoked or expired, which is what a stuck monitor is presenting "
"— and labels it with the credential's state (`revoked`, `expired`, "
"`user_suspended`) beside the user. A row with no user is unresolved, not "
"proof of a stranger: the key may be one this deployment never issued, or "
"the lookup may have been shed, since it runs on a strict budget that "
"gives up first under exactly the flood a block is holding back."
msgstr ""
"到底是哪个调用方？把 `log_rejected_requests` 这个管理设置打开，被拒绝的请求就会以 `ip_blocked` 的形式出现在"
" Recent Requests "
"里。每一行都会给出调用方所带密钥背后的账号——包括已被吊销或已过期的密钥，卡住的监控带的正是这种——并在用户旁边标出该凭据的状态（`revoked`、`expired`、`user_suspended`）。没有用户的那一行是没能查出来，而不是证明对方是陌生人：可能这套部署从来没签发过那个密钥，也可能这次身份查询被丢弃了——它跑在很紧的预算上，而封禁正在挡住的那种洪水，恰恰最先让它放弃。"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:512
msgid "To recover, first fix the credential, then clear the block:"
msgstr "要恢复，先修好凭据，再解除封禁："

#: ../developer/deployment.md:527
msgid ""
"`cleared: false` means there was nothing to lift — it lapsed, or that "
"bucket was never blocked. Clearing grants no immunity: a caller still "
"presenting a bad key is blocked again on crossing the threshold. For a "
"source that should never be blocked at all, list it in "
"`AUTH_FAILURE_BLOCK_EXEMPT_IPS` (comma-separated addresses or CIDRs) "
"instead."
msgstr ""
"`cleared: false` "
"表示没有什么可解除的——封禁已经到期，或者那个分桶从来没被封过。解除不授予任何豁免：仍然带着错误密钥的调用方，越过阈值后会再次被封。对于根本就不该被封的来源，应该把它列进"
" `AUTH_FAILURE_BLOCK_EXEMPT_IPS`（逗号分隔的地址或 CIDR）。"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:533
msgid ""
"The blocklist is per-process, in-memory state. On the single-process "
"default both endpoints are exact, and a restart also clears every block. "
"Run multiple workers and each holds its own counts, so a listing shows "
"only the worker that answered and clearing may take more than one call."
msgstr ""
"黑名单是进程内的内存状态。在默认的单进程部署下，这两个接口给出的都是准确结果，而且重启也会清掉所有封禁。跑多个 worker 时，每个 "
"worker 各记一份计数，所以列表只反映应答的那个 worker，解除也可能需要调用多次。"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:538
msgid "Resetting the stack"
msgstr "重置这套服务栈"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:540
msgid "**Stop and start, keeping data:**"
msgstr "**停止再启动，保留数据：**"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:546
msgid ""
"**Destroy the database and start clean.** `docker compose down -v` does "
"*not* do this. `postgres_data` is declared `external: true` in "
"`deploy/docker/docker-compose.yml`, and Compose never removes an external"
" volume — `down -v` returns success and leaves it fully intact, so `make "
"up` comes back on exactly the same data. Remove it by name:"
msgstr ""
"**销毁数据库、从干净状态开始**。`docker compose down -v` 做*不到*这件事。`postgres_data` 在 "
"`deploy/docker/docker-compose.yml` 里声明为 `external: true`，而 Compose "
"从不删除外部卷——`down -v` 会返回成功，却把卷原封不动地留着，于是 `make up` 又回到完全相同的数据上。要按名字删除它："

#: ../developer/deployment.md:559
msgid ""
"`docker volume rm` is irreversible and takes every account, API key and "
"request log with it. Take a `pg_dump` first if any of it matters."
msgstr ""
"`docker volume rm` 不可逆，会连同每一个账户、每一把 API key 和所有请求日志一起带走。只要其中还有任何东西重要，先做一次"
" `pg_dump`。"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:563
msgid ""
"pgAdmin's own volume (`hybridinference_pgadmin_data`) is an ordinary "
"local volume that `make down` leaves in place. To clear pgAdmin's saved "
"state, remove it by name as described in [Resetting pgAdmin](database.md"
"#resetting-pgadmin)."
msgstr ""
"pgAdmin 自己的卷（`hybridinference_pgadmin_data`）是普通的本地卷，`make down` 不会动它。要清掉 "
"pgAdmin 保存的状态，按[重置 pgAdmin](database.md#resetting-pgadmin) 里的说明按名字删除这个卷。"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:567
msgid "Rebuilding after code changes"
msgstr "改动代码后重新构建"

#~ msgid "A `NEXT_PUBLIC_*` or `AGENT_*` console value"
#~ msgstr "控制台的某个 `NEXT_PUBLIC_*` 或 `AGENT_*` 取值"

